        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I was thinking that with X=0 or 1, damage would be 0 - meaning he can still attack, and can even do damage with the right tools/styles/outside modifiers, and do &quot;damage bursts&quot; after a few turns of building up. Toolbox allows for a total of three cards drawn a round. I fear my suggestion would make him too powerful, he would need low HPs to compensate : Black Fist was a reckless fighter !</p><p>I did not try Fixy with damage = 2, but from what I&#39;ve seen when he plays with Legacy, it could be too much - and make Charge redundant.</p>",
